  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"A Serilum Mod. Made with love. Lots of active mods for Fabric, Forge and Neo!\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"About the mod\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Creative Block Replacer 是一款极简主义模组，允许玩家在创造模式中轻松切换放置和替换方块的功能，从而加快创造过程。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"Dependencies\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"Requires Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"Environment: Server\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"Showcase\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><strong>切换方块替换模式：</strong><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>在原地连续潜行三次</em></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/creative-block-replacer/a.png\" alt=\"enabled\" width=\"465\" height=\"33\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/creative-block-replacer/b.png\" alt=\"disabled\" width=\"465\" height=\"33\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/creative-block-replacer/c.webp\" alt=\"sneakgif\" width=\"848\" height=\"474\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>当启用方块替换模式时，右键点击方块将用手中物品替换目标方块：</strong><br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/creative-block-replacer/e.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"847\" height=\"473\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"Notes and links\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下载源保持在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统内，您可以自由在任何整合包中使用此模组。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于我无法在众多独立的模组页面中跟踪评论，因此已关闭评论功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事宜，请访问 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
